Subject: [PATCH 1229/3799] soh: rename func_80095AA0 -> Room_HandleDebugInput

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: an empty function called once per frame for the current and previous room with the second controller's input; controller 2 is this codebase's debug controller, so that is where the name comes from, but nothing about the stripped body confirms it.
Defined in soh/src/code/z_room.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/include/functions.h | 2 +-
 soh/src/code/z_play.c   | 4 ++--
 soh/src/code/z_room.c   | 3 ++-
 3 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

